<glyph name="uni0328" format="2">
  <unicode hex="0328"/>
  <note>
Joining ogonek tail. Uses a dedicated _ogonek anchor; selected base join positions are optically placed, never the detached bottom-dot anchor.
Weight master: 正文中粗：竖茎 108、横画 94，比 Regular 暗一档，但横画追得更快，对比下降。B 上碗开始收、下碗保持，腰轻收。M 谷加深而不是简单加粗。字距略紧。
</note>
